	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I set the permissions for a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| Assign Contact | true |
	And I set the permissions for a contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| View | true |
	And I set the permissions for the contact role "Default Account Worker Role" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| Assign Contact | true |
	And I assign the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" to the following roles as a permissioned user	
	| Default Account Worker Role |
	Then the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should have the contact role "Default Account Worker Role"
	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should have the contact role "Member"

